# Tracking

Never create, search, update, or mention Linear issues for this project. Do not use Linear MCP.

Work items are markdown files under `tickets/`. Read `tickets/README.md` and follow it: status is the folder (`todo/`, `in-progress/`, `done/`); one concern per file; English; no invented ticket IDs.

New follow-ups go in `tickets/todo/`. Do not revive `NOTES.md` or start another notes dump.
